# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER commit real keys to version control)
#
# Option 1 (Prototyping / Zero-Billing): Get a free Maps Demo Key
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
#   4. Click to generate / reveal your demo key
#   5. Copy it into a local .env file as GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<your_key>
#
# Option 2 (Production): Create and restrict a key in Google Cloud Console
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API, Street View
#   Restrict by HTTP referrer (for browser) and/or server IP & designated APIs:
#   https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
PORT=3000
